Package: multicore
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: MultiCore <noreply@multicore.invalid>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: libgtk-3-0, libayatana-appindicator3-1 | libappindicator3-1, pkexec | policykit-1, libxkbcommon0, libfontconfig1, libgl1, iproute2
Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Description: Native network client combining Mihomo routing with Xray transports
 MultiCore starts Mihomo and Xray behind one desktop interface. Mihomo owns
 TUN, DNS, rules, and selectors; Xray provides the outbound transports.
